id: true-form-conquered-mutation
name: Conquered Mutation
order: 2
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1, 2
description: >
  You have finally, at long last, mastered the power you were born with, and this power is now wholly yours to command.
text: >
  Conquered Mutation: You have finally, at long last, mastered the power you were born with, and this power is now wholly yours to command.
  (1)-[Permanent]: True Form loses the Long Transformation and Exhausting Aspects.
  (2)-[Permanent]: All Stages of Metamorphosis gain the Perfect Ki Control Aspect.
  (3)-[Passive]: Ignore the 3rd effect of Suppression of Power.

